 sink terminations." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 196.586 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86456dce-cad7-4da7-9d78-504fd921dd35")) (text "Route the USB 2.0 pair short and matched, directly to the module. Place U323 and C324 next to J310; keep VBUS_CON copper short and on the top layer (TI layout guide)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 198.771 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be7c8fdc-de0b-4aa1-8cff-3730c389f230")))